in Kansas staat naast haar vroege werk als danseres en haar ontmoetingen in de filmwereld. Bekende namen verschijnen daarbij als mensen met wie zij daadwerkelijk omging, niet alleen als figuren op het scherm. De stukken verbinden herinneringen aan haar eigen loopbaan met de omgeving waarin dans, roem en film samenkwamen. Het boek bestaat uit persoonlijke beschouwingen en vormt geen doorlopende, allesomvattende biografie.","work_id":987146051,"evidence":[{"note":"Retain existing Work5163 Lulu in Hollywood / Louise Brooks and exact Dutch Loulou in Hollywood 9789026940347 Paperback. KB original-title/volume and existing source-edition parent compared; original content review content-review-028.json retained. No abridgment, omnibus or translated-title duplication established for this selected edition. This changes presentation metadata/summary only; do not claim additionalDutchavailability.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p052876705"],"reference":"work:5163","checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:26:38.922Z","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-028.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL4772459W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p052876705"]},{"note":"Exact bound bulk source attempt retained. No image claimedverifiedorimported; preserve current resolver. Require decodedexactfront or documentedneutralplaceholder in hostedacceptance; noEnglishsubstitution.","type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","isbn13":"9789026940347","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","attempts":[{"status":"bulk_archive_unavailable","coverId":7883688,"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","receiptSha256":"da70559e4d5f2dd3576e79714062a3263062ebe5401e0ef0ac880c708f94ec64"}],"checkedAt":"2026-11-03T09:26:38.922Z","editionKey":"/books/OL26200448M","limitation":"No verified image is imported. Existing neutral placeholder; not proof that no cover exists at the provider 